From ed406dd5a231265499af1bdfdf0e0f673d2f517b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:26:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] fix: tolerate unloadable types when scanning assemblies

The requirement, result and zone component registries scan every loaded
assembly. One assembly with an unresolvable reference (for example a
broken plugin) made GetTypes throw inside a static constructor, breaking
the whole registry. Skip and log the types that cannot load instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../Requirements/RequirementDispatcher.cs     |  3 +-
 .../Game/Results/ResultDispatcher.cs          |  3 +-
 .../Zone/Core/ZoneEntityComponentRegistry.cs  |  3 +-
 .../Shared/Utilities/AssemblyTypes.cs         | 62 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/Imlight.CoreLib/Shared/Utilities/AssemblyTypes.cs

diff --git a/src/Imlight.CoreLib/Game/Requirements/RequirementDispatcher.cs b/src/Imlight.CoreLib/Game/Requirements/RequirementDispatcher.cs
